from pathlib import Path
import json,hashlib,shutil
from PIL import Image,ImageDraw,ImageFont,ImageOps
ROOT=Path('C:/GrandTour');QA=ROOT/'Saved/LidarAuthoringQA/LeafGeometry';CAP=QA/'Capture';OUT=ROOT/'Art/Export/LidarStudy/CohesiveStyle/LeafGeometryReview';OUT.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)
load=lambda p:json.loads(p.read_text(encoding='utf-8-sig'))
process=load(CAP/'process.json');install=load(QA/'install.json');assert process['ok'] and install['ok']
for p in CAP.glob('*.png'):shutil.copy2(p,OUT/p.name)
font=lambda n:ImageFont.truetype('C:/Windows/Fonts/segoeui.ttf',n)
for ident in ['sunlit','close','road']:
 board=Image.new('RGB',(1832,670),'#11201e');d=ImageDraw.Draw(board)
 d.text((20,12),'LIDAR / SMALLER LEAVES WITH REAL SHAPE',font=font(28),fill='#eee9d8')
 d.text((20,53),'Actual game frames / same camera and render settings / '+ident,font=font(20),fill='#becbbd')
 for i,label in enumerate(['PREVIOUS / LARGE MASKED SPRAYS','CURRENT / INDIVIDUAL CUPPED LEAVES']):
  x=20+i*906;d.text((x,96),label,font=font(20),fill='#eee9d8')
  im=Image.open(OUT/(ident+('-before' if i==0 else '-after')+'.png')).convert('RGB');board.paste(ImageOps.contain(im,(886,500)),(x,136))
 board.save(OUT/(ident+'-comparison.jpg'),quality=95)
rows=''.join('<tr><td>'+r['kind']+'</td><td>'+format(r['before_triangles'][0],',')+'</td><td>'+format(r['after_triangles'][0],',')+'</td><td>'+', '.join(format(x,',') for x in r['after_triangles'][1:])+'</td></tr>' for r in install['meshes'])
page='''<!doctype html><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"><title>LiDAR shaped leaves</title><style>body{margin:28px;background:#11201e;color:#eee9d8;font:17px/1.6 system-ui}p{max-width:1100px}a{color:#bad8b5}img{max-width:100%}th,td{text-align:left;padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #536453}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}select{padding:10px}@media(max-width:800px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style><h1>Smaller leaves with real curvature</h1><p>The nearest tree LOD now uses individual leaves with a cup, curled tip and twist, with varied size, orientation and vertex colour. Leaf length averages 21–22 cm, spanning approximately 13–33 cm before placed-tree scale. Each leaf has six vertices and four triangles. Smooth imported normals follow its actual geometry. The near-leaf material is opaque and two-sided; it avoids the earlier overlapping alpha-cutout sprays.</p><label>Compare <select id="view"><option value="sunlit">Sunward crown</option><option value="close">Shaded close view</option><option value="road">Roadside context</option></select></label><div class="grid"><div><h3>Previous pass</h3><img id="before" src="sunlit-before.png"></div><div><h3>Current game</h3><img id="after" src="sunlit-after.png"></div></div><p>Unretouched 888 × 500 native game captures at 100% screen percentage. Earlier-pass images were retained from the preceding review at matching camera positions and rendering settings. Vegetation streaming can differ between runs. The upper-crown camera is an inspection view, not player eye height.</p><h2>Geometry budget</h2><table><tr><th>Tree</th><th>Previous nearest LOD</th><th>New nearest LOD</th><th>Unchanged cheaper LODs</th></tr>'''+rows+'''</table><p>The two active material sections remain bark plus leaves. No trees, textures or map actors were added. The existing three cheaper LODs, their screen thresholds, far canopy assets, palette, fog and road materials are preserved. This bounds the geometry increase to the nearest LOD; it is not a guarantee of equal frame time. GPU timings and motion stability remain unverified under the existing shared-GPU constraint.</p><h2>Natural LOD range checks</h2><div class="grid"><div><h3>Approximately 20 m horizontally from target</h3><img src="range20-after.png"></div><div><h3>Approximately 35 m horizontally from target</h3><img src="range35-after.png"></div></div><p>These use natural LOD selection, not forced detail. Other trees can lie closer to the camera. Still images cannot establish transition smoothness in motion.</p><p><a href="sunlit-comparison.jpg">Sunlit comparison board</a> / <a href="close-comparison.jpg">Shaded comparison board</a> / <a href="road-comparison.jpg">Roadside comparison board</a> / <a href="evidence.json">Validation evidence</a></p><script>document.getElementById('view').onchange=function(){for(let suffix of ['before','after'])document.getElementById(suffix).src=this.value+'-'+suffix+'.png'}</script>'''
(OUT/'index.html').write_text(page,encoding='utf-8')
e=dict(install=install,capture=process,geometry=load(ROOT/'Art/Export/LidarStudy/LeafGeometry/manifest.json'),performance_verified=False,motion_verified=False,sha256={p.name:hashlib.sha256(p.read_bytes()).hexdigest() for p in OUT.glob('*.png')})
(OUT/'evidence.json').write_text(json.dumps(e,indent=2));print(OUT)
